		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a49" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts96" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts97">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>This had nothing to do with Tarski, but just as an example, you know, we had this big thing about Jenny Harrison.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a50" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts98" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts99">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And Jenny Harrison wanted to have a series of Julia Robinson Memorial Lectures, which Raphael and I, caught unawares, kind of agreed to, and then when we heard about really well, they were typical of her, the people who she just wanted absolute control of these things and so forth.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a51" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts100" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts101">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And they were really kind of a continuation of this anti departmental thing or more in the department.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
